msgid "Flatpak app from {source}"
msgstr "來自 {source} 的 Flatpak 應用程式"

#: appinstaller.rs:851
msgid "AppImage"
msgstr "AppImage"

#: appinstaller.rs:869
msgid "You will be guided through the steps necessary to install this software."
msgstr "我們將引導您完成安裝此軟體所需的步驟。"

#: appinstaller.rs:880
msgid "Version"
msgstr "版本"

#: appinstaller.rs:883
msgid "Publisher"
msgstr "發行者"

#: appinstaller.rs:885
msgid "Type"
msgstr "類型"

#: appinstaller.rs:887
msgid "Size"
msgstr "大小"

#: appinstaller.rs:893
msgid "Website"
msgstr "網站"

#: appinstaller.rs:895
msgid "File"
msgstr "檔案"

#: appinstaller.rs:905
msgid "This app is installed already. Installing it again replaces it."
msgstr "此應用程式已經安裝。再次安裝會取代它。"

#: appinstaller.rs:908
msgid "Apps from .deb packages become part of the system. A MAN update replaces the system, so they are only installed again after an update if you keep them (next steps)."
msgstr ".deb 套件中的應用程式會成為系統的一部分。MAN 更新會取代系統，因此只有選擇保留的應用程式才會在更新後重新安裝（後續步驟）。"

#: appinstaller.rs:911
msgid "Only install apps from sources you trust."
msgstr "請只安裝來自可信任來源的應用程式。"

#: appinstaller.rs:917
msgid "Where do you want to install {name}?"
msgstr "您想將 {name} 安裝在哪裡？"

#: appinstaller.rs:922
msgid "Only your account can use the app."
msgstr "只有您的帳號可以使用此應用程式。"

#: appinstaller.rs:923
msgid "Needs administrator rights."
msgstr "需要管理員權限。"

#: appinstaller.rs:930
msgid "Only for Me"
msgstr "僅限我"

#: appinstaller.rs:930
msgid "For All Users of This Computer"
msgstr "這台電腦的所有使用者"

#: appinstaller.rs:945
msgid "This will take {size} of space on your computer."
msgstr "將佔用電腦上 {size} 的空間。"

#: appinstaller.rs:947
msgid "The app is downloaded from {source}."
msgstr "應用程式將從 {source} 下載。"

#: appinstaller.rs:949
msgid "The app is installed for all users of this computer."
msgstr "應用程式將為這台電腦的所有使用者安裝。"

#: appinstaller.rs:949
msgid "The app is installed only for you."
msgstr "應用程式將只為您安裝。"

#: appinstaller.rs:952
msgid "The AppImage is moved to {folder} and added to your apps."
msgstr "AppImage 會移到 {folder} 並加入您的應用程式。"

#: appinstaller.rs:958
msgid "Keep After MAN Updates"
msgstr "MAN 更新後保留"

#: appinstaller.rs:959
msgid "MAN installs the app again after each update. Its package files are kept for that."
msgstr "MAN 會在每次更新後重新安裝此應用程式，為此會保留它的套件檔案。"

#: appinstaller.rs:967
msgid "Click Install to install {name}."
msgstr "按一下「安裝」以安裝 {name}。"

#: appinstaller.rs:973
msgid "Checking what else the app needs…"
msgstr "正在檢查應用程式還需要什麼…"

#: appinstaller.rs:983
msgid "Also installs the packages it needs: {list}"
msgstr "也會安裝它需要的套件：{list}"

#: appinstaller.rs:989
msgid "Some packages the app needs are not available yet. Installing gets the newest package lists first; if they are still missing, the app cannot be installed."
msgstr "應用程式需要的某些套件暫時無法使用。安裝時會先取得最新的套件清單；如果仍然缺少，則無法安裝此應用程式。"

#: appinstaller.rs:1050
msgid "Installing {name}…"
msgstr "正在安裝 {name}…"

#: appinstaller.rs:1056
msgid "Preparing…"
msgstr "正在準備…"

#: appinstaller.rs:1063
msgid "Details"
msgstr "詳細資訊"

#: appinstaller.rs:1103
msgid "Installing the package…"
msgstr "正在安裝套件…"

#: appinstaller.rs:1122
msgid "Moving the app to its folder…"
msgstr "正在將應用程式移到它的資料夾…"

#: appinstaller.rs:1131
