msgid "Could not start the system helper."
msgstr "無法啟動系統助手。"

#: backend.rs:57
msgid "Could not talk to the system helper."
msgstr "無法與系統助手通訊。"

#: backend.rs:77
msgid "Lost contact with the system helper."
msgstr "與系統助手的連線已中斷。"

#: backend.rs:87
msgid "Authorization was cancelled."
msgstr "授權已取消。"

#: backend.rs:87
msgid "Administrator rights are needed for this action."
msgstr "此操作需要管理員權限。"

#: backend.rs:89
msgid "The system helper stopped unexpectedly."
msgstr "系統助手意外停止。"

#: installer.rs:78
msgid "No EFI system partition"
msgstr "沒有 EFI 系統分割區"

#: installer.rs:82
msgid "Only {free} free, MAN needs {need}. Make more room with DUHACH! in Windows."
msgstr "僅剩 {free} 可用，MAN 需要 {need}。請在 Windows 中用 DUHACH! 騰出空間。"

#: installer.rs:83
msgid "No free space. Start DUHACH! in Windows to make room for MAN."
msgstr "沒有可用空間。請在 Windows 中啟動 DUHACH! 為 MAN 騰出空間。"

#: installer.rs:92
msgid "MAN is running from this disk"
msgstr "MAN 正從此磁碟執行"

#: installer.rs:96
msgid "In use: a partition is mounted"
msgstr "使用中：有分割區已掛載"

#: installer.rs:98
msgid "Too small, MAN needs {need}"
msgstr "太小，MAN 需要 {need}"

#: installer.rs:108
msgid "Install MAN"
msgstr "安裝 MAN"

#: installer.rs:126
msgid "MAN is being installed. Please wait until it finishes."
msgstr "正在安裝 MAN。請等待完成。"

#: installer.rs:143
msgid "Language"
msgstr "語言"

#: installer.rs:155
msgid "_Restart in This Language"
msgstr "以此語言重新啟動(_R)"

#: installer.rs:167
msgid "The live session restarts in the chosen language, and MAN is installed in it."
msgstr "Live 工作階段將以所選語言重新啟動，MAN 也會以該語言安裝。"

#: installer.rs:213
msgid "Welcome to MAN"
msgstr "歡迎使用 MAN"

#: installer.rs:214
msgid ""
"A fast, open and fully customizable GNOME system.\n"
"Install it on this computer, or keep exploring the live session."
msgstr ""
"快速、開放、可完全自訂的 GNOME 系統。\n"
"將它安裝到這台電腦上，或繼續體驗 Live 工作階段。"

#: installer.rs:218
msgid "_Install MAN…"
msgstr "安裝 MAN(_I)…"

#: installer.rs:220
msgid "_Keep Trying MAN"
msgstr "繼續試用 MAN(_K)"

#: installer.rs:223
msgid "Looking for disks…"
msgstr "正在尋找磁碟…"

#: installer.rs:250
msgid "Welcome"
msgstr "歡迎"

#: installer.rs:265
msgid "This computer was started in legacy BIOS mode. MAN can only be installed on UEFI computers: restart and choose the UEFI boot option."
msgstr "這台電腦以傳統 BIOS 模式啟動。MAN 只能安裝在 UEFI 電腦上：請重新啟動並選擇 UEFI 開機選項。"

#: installer.rs:283
msgid "The system helper returned no disk information."
msgstr "系統助手沒有傳回磁碟資訊。"

#: installer.rs:348
msgid "  ·  EFI"
msgstr "  ·  EFI"

#: installer.rs:356
msgid "_Next"
msgstr "下一步(_N)"

#: installer.rs:364
msgid "Erase Disk and Install MAN"
msgstr "清除磁碟並安裝 MAN"

#: installer.rs:365
msgid "Everything on the chosen disk is deleted, Windows included."
msgstr "所選磁碟上的所有內容都會被刪除，包括 Windows。"

#: installer.rs:365
msgid "Recommended. Everything on the chosen disk is deleted."
msgstr "建議。所選磁碟上的所有內容都會被刪除。"

#: installer.rs:369
msgid "Install Alongside Windows"
msgstr "與 Windows 並存安裝"

#: installer.rs:370
msgid "Recommended. MAN uses the free space next to Windows; Windows and its files stay. Choose the system at every start."
msgstr "建議。MAN 使用 Windows 旁的可用空間；Windows 及其檔案保持不變。每次開機時選擇系統。"

#: installer.rs:377
msgid "Reinstall MAN"
msgstr "重新安裝 MAN"

#: installer.rs:378
msgid "Replaces the system but keeps personal files in /home. The current system is saved as a snapshot."
msgstr "取代系統，但保留 /home 中的個人檔案。目前的系統會儲存為快照。"

#: installer.rs:383
msgid "Custom Partitions"
msgstr "自訂分割區"

#: installer.rs:383
msgid "For experts: choose partitions yourself, or create them with Disks."
msgstr "專家適用：自行選擇分割區，或用「磁碟」建立分割區。"

#: installer.rs:392
msgid "Disk"
msgstr "磁碟"

#: installer.rs:392
msgid "Choose the disk to erase. Disks that cannot be used are shown with the reason."
msgstr "選擇要清除的磁碟。無法使用的磁碟會顯示原因。"

#: installer.rs:418
msgid "No disks were found"
msgstr "找不到磁碟"

#: installer.rs:425
msgid "Free Space Next to Windows"
msgstr "Windows 旁的可用空間"

#: installer.rs:426
msgid "Windows' partitions are not touched. MAN shares the EFI system partition and adds Windows to its start menu."
msgstr "不會變更 Windows 的分割區。MAN 共用 EFI 系統分割區，並把 Windows 加入其開機選單。"

#: installer.rs:432
msgid "{size} free"
msgstr "{size} 可用"

#: installer.rs:432
msgid "no free space"
msgstr "無可用空間"

#: installer.rs:437
msgid "{model} (Windows)"
msgstr "{model}（Windows）"

