msgstr "開啟（LUKS2）"

#: installer.rs:983
msgid "Off"
msgstr "關閉"

#: installer.rs:985
msgid "File System"
msgstr "檔案系統"

#: installer.rs:986
msgid "Btrfs: @system for MAN, @home for your files, @snapshots for restore points. All share the free space."
msgstr "Btrfs：@system 用於 MAN，@home 用於您的檔案，@snapshots 用於還原點。它們共用可用空間。"

#: installer.rs:991
msgid "System"
msgstr "系統"

#: installer.rs:993
